[Header start]
! Three jokes, each with a setup, a beat, and a reaction.
! The BEAT is the animation — a joke told without a pause is a
! sentence, and the pause is a D on a clip.
[Header end]

[Resources start]
K[1]: 'characters/crazy eyes/eyes.py'
[Resources end]

[Main start]
MATH K[1] STATE[idle] D[0.6]
SAY TXT['I told my friend I was building a rig with two identical eyes.']
MATH K[1] STATE[idle] LOOK[left] D[0.9]
SAY TXT['He said, so you are seeing someone.']
MATH K[1] STATE[squint] D[1.2]
SAY TXT['I have not spoken to him since.']

MATH K[1] STATE[alert] D[0.8]
SAY TXT['Why do I never win at hide and seek?']
MATH K[1] STATE[scan] D[1.6]
SAY TXT['I glow.']
MATH K[1] STATE[idle] LOOK[down] D[1.0]

MATH K[1] STATE[idle] D[0.6]
SAY TXT['My optometrist said I have a lazy eye.']
MATH K[1] STATE[idle] WINK[right] D[1.0]
SAY TXT['I said that one is doing all the work, the other one is management.']
MATH K[1] STATE[cross] D[1.4]
[Main end]
